  License: BSD-3-Clause.
  /opt/scrapling/lib/python3.13/site-packages/scrapling-0.4.15.dist-info/licenses/LICENSE.

  Its Python dependencies, each with its license in its *.dist-info folder under
  /opt/scrapling/lib/python3.13/site-packages:
