Browser
-------

- Chrome for Testing 153.0.8010.12 (Playwright chromium revision 1243), downloaded by Playwright
  into /opt/ms-playwright/chromium-1243. Built from the Chromium open source project
  (BSD-3-Clause, https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/+/main/LICENSE); the licenses of
  its third-party components are listed at chrome://credits in the browser. Its ABOUT file, in the
  same folder, refers to Google's terms of service at chrome://terms.
- FFmpeg (Playwright build 1011), used by Playwright for video, in /opt/ms-playwright/ffmpeg-1011.
  License: LGPL-2.1, COPYING.LGPLv2.1 in that folder.

Downloaded at runtime, not bundled
----------------------------------

- EmbeddingGemma 300M (Google), the built-in embedding model, in its ONNX conversion
  onnx-community/embeddinggemma-300m-ONNX. The worker downloads it from Hugging Face on its first
  start into MODELS_DIR; no image contains it. Gemma is provided under and subject to the Gemma
  Terms of Use found at https://ai.google.dev/gemma/terms, with its Prohibited Use Policy at
  https://ai.google.dev/gemma/prohibited_use_policy.
